# GestureFlow AI does NOT require any environment variables to run.
# This file exists to make that explicit and to document the (optional) knobs.
#
# The application is offline and keyless: there are no API keys, tokens, or
# secrets, because it never talks to a remote service.  Nothing here is loaded
# automatically; these are reference notes only.

# --- Optional: none are required -------------------------------------------
# Where the app keeps its SQLite database, logs and config.
#   Default (Windows):  %APPDATA%\GestureFlowAI
#   Override the parent folder by setting APPDATA (a standard Windows variable).

# Where the MediaPipe hand-landmark model was downloaded during setup.
#   Default: assets/models/hand_landmarker.task  (see scripts/download_model.py)
